> I have translated into lojban the amusing children's story of 
> Ferdinand the Bull, with the intention that it be useful for lojban 
> learners.
> The grammar and vocabulary are standard, nothing experimental, with 
> minimal use of affix compounds or complex nesting.
> I do prefer "h" to "'".
>
